Samples from the interrupt path (rate-limited) and from a timer when idle;
optional read of a waiting packet. SPI only. Compiled and unit-tested; this
exact version has not been run on hardware (an earlier local variant was).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
